---
title: What's Next
description: Further resources for customizing and extending the Vonage Video Android App theme.
---

Congratulations! You have successfully customized the Vonage Video Android reference app's visual theme using `theme.json`, running the app locally against the shared backend.

## What You Accomplished

- Started the shared backend server in this Codespace and made its port public
- Cloned `vonage-video-android-app` to your own machine, pointed it at the backend via `local.properties`, and ran the app
- Understood the structure of `config/theme.json`, including its color, `borderRadius`, and typography tokens
- Edited theme tokens in `theme.json` and regenerated the Compose theme resources with `./gradlew generateVonageConfig`
- Rebuilt the app and confirmed your changes on an emulator or device

## What's Next

Want to also enable or disable app features? Continue with the companion **Vonage Video Android App Feature Config** tutorial — it picks up from the same local setup and walks through `config/app-config.json`.

