- [Vonage Developer Portal](https://developer.vonage.com) — Documentation, guides, and API references for all Vonage products.
- [Vonage Video API Documentation](https://developer.vonage.com/en/video/overview) — In-depth guides for the Video API.
- [vonage-video-android-app on GitHub](https://github.com/Vonage/vonage-video-android-app) — Source code, full documentation, and contribution guidelines.
- [Configuration reference](https://github.com/Vonage/vonage-video-android-app/blob/main/docs/CONFIGURATION.md) — Feature flags, theme customization, and base URL setup.
